# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# The working tree had been rewritten with CRLF while every committed blob is
# LF, so `git status` reported 84 files and ~34,500 changed lines when only ~291
# lines were real edits. That made every diff unreviewable and would have buried
# real changes inside line-ending churn.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` converts on the way INTO the index, so committed content
# stays LF while Windows checkouts keep whatever the editor wants. No file needs
# rewriting for this to take effect.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
